# Unity generated
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Built map bundles, and the zips made from them for mod.io. The build commands write both;
# they are uploaded, never committed.
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets.meta
/ModioUploads/

# Maps made in this copy of the kit that are not part of the kit: test maps, examples, work in
# progress. Keep them under Assets/LocalMaps/<MapName>/ and they never reach the kit's history.
/[Aa]ssets/LocalMaps/
/[Aa]ssets/LocalMaps.meta

# Which mod.io page each bundle uploads to, written by Upload Maps to mod.io. Ignored so the kit
# never ships with a mapping in it. Remove this line in your own project to commit yours.
/ProjectSettings/ModioMapUploads.json

# IDE and solution files Unity regenerates
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.gradle/
